  "question": "1) Background / Context\n\nThe project involves developing an OAuth2 client and server for Django. This system will provide a comprehensive solution, including endpoints, data handling, and logic, to integrate OAuth2 authentication into Django projects, enabling secure API access and token management.\n\n2) Objectives\n\n- Implement OAuth2 authentication to protect web APIs within Django applications.\n- Provide an OAuth2 authorization server for token management.\n- Ensure adherence to RFC standards using OAuthLib for compliance and security.\n\n3) Stakeholders & Users\n\n- Developers: Integrating OAuth2 authentication into Django projects.\n- API Consumers: Accessing secured web APIs using OAuth2 tokens.\n- System Administrators: Managing OAuth2 clients, tokens, and user authentication.\n\n4) Functional Descriptions\n\n- Create multiple OAuth2 endpoints for authorization, token issuance, and token revocation.\n- Enable developers to manage applications (clients) with attributes like client ID, secret, and redirect URIs.\n- Handle OAuth2 grant types such as authorization code, implicit, and client credentials.\n- Allow users to authenticate and authorize third-party applications to access their data.\n- Utilize access and refresh tokens for session management, supporting token expiration and renewal.\n\n5) Non-Functional Descriptions\n\n- Ensure that the system is RFC-compliant for standardization and security.\n- Provide a scalable solution capable of handling multiple simultaneous API requests.\n- Utilize secure methods for storing and transmitting sensitive information, such as client secrets and user credentials.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: schemabench_0031\nCREATE TABLE `oauth2_application` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `client_id` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `client_secret` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `client_type` varchar(32) NOT NULL,\n  `authorization_grant_type` varchar(32) NOT NULL,\n  `redirect_uris` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `skip_authorization` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  `created` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `updated` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `oauth2_application_client_id_uniq` (`client_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\nCREATE TABLE `oauth2_access_token` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `token` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `expires` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `scope` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `application_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `created` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `oauth2_access_token_token_uniq` (`token`),\n  KEY `oauth2_access_token_application_id_idx` (`application_id`),\n  KEY `oauth2_access_token_user_id_idx` (`user_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `oauth2_access_token_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`application_id`) REFERENCES `oauth2_application` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `oauth2_access_token_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `auth_user` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\nCREATE TABLE `oauth2_refresh_token` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `token` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `access_token_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `application_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `created` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `oauth2_refresh_token_token_uniq` (`token`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `oauth2_refresh_token_access_token_id_uniq` (`access_token_id`),\n  KEY `oauth2_refresh_token_application_id_idx` (`application_id`),\n  KEY `oauth2_refresh_token_user_id_idx` (`user_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `oauth2_refresh_token_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`access_token_id`) REFERENCES `oauth2_access_token` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `oauth2_refresh_token_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`application_id`) REFERENCES `oauth2_application` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `oauth2_refresh_token_ibfk_3` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `auth_user` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
